Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:19:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/16] Fix Seasoned Cryomancer filtered discard count

Bind the reflexive target cardinality to matching discarded cards, and preserve the target set announced by the reflexive body.

Analogues: Nyssa of Traken's reflexive up-to target count in reflexive_sacrifice_this_way_taps_and_draws_that_many; Dread Summons's filtered tracked-set count in for_each_creature_card_this_way_counts_only_creatures.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
